: are reluctant to swap the  memory board.

: Does the 1000 have a memory test that can be invoked from the console?
: If so can it be run continiously for a period of time?

The VMS console firmware has had memory tests on all Alpha machines I've
used.  You may have to use the ARC console firmware to switch to the
VMS console firmware, if this machine has it.  Then you can try to get
the memory test.  Or, just type T or TEST.  That will run an intensive
