Well - I solved the problem.

Before you install Digital Unix (V4.0) always run ECU first.
Eventhough I don't have any devices on the EISA bus the SIO
controllers are integrated there.

So, I had to run ECU and then edit my /sys/conf/SYSTEM file to 
add device support for the ace0/1 devices off of EISA.

Then everything else worked.

Hoping this helps others in the future,
