>it be purchaced separately.  What package
>would it be in?
>-- 
>from Bob Williams, mailto:bob@bob.usuf2.usuhs.mil

The libcxx.so library is shipped with the Digital UNIX operating system.
On version 3.n systems, the library is in the optional subset CXXSHRDA.
Starting with version 4.0, the library is in the mandatory subset 
OSFBASE.




