Yes there is

Check out C2 security options (an optional subset for digital UNIX)
It incorperates things like password ageing, auto disable of an account, 
and audit checking, but there are some nasty problems you can get into 
e.g. if the /etc/passwd is corrupted (someone editied it directly), or 
